aln
File,aln/daily-evolution-manifest-nanoswarm-tfus.v1.aln
Type,QPU.Datashard
Purpose,Define a DailyEvolutionManifest shard binding cyberfs://manifests/daily-evolution.json to nanoswarm+tFUS OTA episodes, require Rust/Kani consistency harness re-runs on manifest updates, and constrain daily evolution under Cybercore/Organichain sovereignty. Designed for https://github.com/mk-bluebird/Nano-Tree and mk-bluebird/Cybercore.

