SECTION,INVARIANTS
ROW,invariant,manifest_consistency_binding,rule,manifest_consistency_binding,string,nonnull,"For any manifest date, every episodeid listed MUST have a cyberfspath_consistency that resolves to a CyberFS object conforming to aln/cyberfs-consistency-checks-nanoswarm-tfus.v1, and consistencyshardid MUST equal daily-evolution-manifest-nanoswarm-tfus.v1.meta.consistencyshardid."
ROW,invariant,episode_checks_required,rule,episode_checks_required,string,nonnull,"For any episode with telepathic_lane_verdict == 'Allow', fp_mass_consistency, fp_density_below_threshold, tfus_within_safety_envelope, tfus_approvals_match_tx_log, and no_dual_violation_nanoswarm_tfus MUST all be true. Episodes with any check == false MUST NOT be used for OTA execution and MUST be quarantined or tagged for remediation."
ROW,invariant,kaniharness_rerun_on_update,rule,kaniharness_rerun_on_update,string,nonnull,"Any update to cyberfs://manifests/daily-evolution.json (manifestjsonhash change, episode additions/removals, or check flag mutations) SHALL trigger the CI workflow .github/workflows/daily-evolution-consistency.yml, which MUST re-run nanoswarm_fp_consistency_harness, tfus_safety_envelope_harness, and nanoswarm_tfus_dual_constraint_harness on the updated telemetry corpus. Commits altering the manifest without a passing Kani run MUST be rejected."
ROW,invariant,no_unverified_manifest_use,rule,no_unverified_manifest_use,string,nonnull,"Runtime components in mk-bluebird/Nano-Tree, mk-bluebird/Cybercore, and mk-bluebird/Organichain MUST treat any manifest with verifiercommitrequired == true and missing a successful CI/Kani verifier commit as non-authoritative. Daily evolution automation MUST read only manifests whose manifestjsonhash is signed or tagged as Kani-verified."
ROW,invariant,hostbinding,rule,hostbinding,string,nonnull,"Manifest hostdid and bostromaddress MUST bind to didalnorganic-host and bostrom18sd2ujv24ual9c9pshtxys6j8knh6xaead9ye7, and any deviation MUST invalidate the manifest."

SECTION,DAILY-EVOLUTION-USAGE
ROW,usage,component,scalar,component,string,nonnull,"Nano-Tree-kernels|Cybercore-CI|Organichain-telepathic-lane"
ROW,usage,behavior,scalar,behavior,string,nonnull,"On each day, load manifest from cyberfs://manifests/daily-evolution.json, iterate episodes with telepathic_lane_verdict == 'Allow', and schedule OTA operations ONLY for episodes where all consistency checks and Kani-verifier tags are valid. For episodes with Defer or Deny, record research/diagnostic actions but do not actuate nanoswarms or tFUS."

FOOTER,END-OF-SHARD
